Package: agropvR
Title: Tools for Mapping Environmental Impacts of Agrophotovoltaics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Marlene", "Sehrbrock", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: AgropvR uses Sentinel 2 imagery from 2024 (April to October) to calculate NDVI, NDMI and BSI for 25 sites across Baden-Wuerttemberg. Each site contains a site with an agrophotoltaic sstem on it, and an agricultural reference field. Statistics are extracted and the final result is a map displaying the three indices for a selected month.
